Item:
Id: 705001
MsgCtxt: STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION
MsgId: Mmmm, tree food!
MsgStr: Ưm, thức ăn cho cây!

Item:
Id: 705002
MsgCtxt: STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.BURNING
